    { "dot": "cyan", "title": "Surface", "items": [
      "dispatch() — one upstream attempt, at interactive or batch priority",
      "get_model_catalogue() — prompt-registry's model picker, read-only (INT-016)",
      "Ten management operations over six paths; the credential is write-only",
      "Callers: gateway, evaluation, registry trials, readiness probes"
